@companyPk = 1

### Balance Sheet - Default date (today)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/balance-sheet/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Balance Sheet - Specific date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/balance-sheet/?as_of_date=2026-10-23
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Balance Sheet - Superadmin and specific company
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/balance-sheet/?company_pk={{companyPk}}&as_of_date=2026-10-23
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Invalid date - should return HTTP 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/balance-sheet/?as_of_date=23-10-2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
